OL,3,GNEWSAFour free buses trialled on rural
OL,4,Aroutes
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour free bus routes are being trialled
OL,7,Fthrough a network of rural areas by
OL,8,FLeicestershire County Council.
OL,10,FFrom Monday, there will be routes from
OL,11,FDiseworth to Loughborough, Bottesford
OL,12,Fto Bingham, Blaby to South Wigston via
OL,13,FNarborough, as well as Blaby to
OL,14,FHinckley.
OL,16,FThe LC18, LC19, LC20 and LC21 buses
OL,17,Fwill run on weekdays from 10:00 to
OL,18,F14:00 on a 12-month trial, with the
OL,19,Fcouncil providing the vehicles.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
