OL,3,GNEWSAFour free buses trialled on rural
OL,4,Aroutes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Andrew Hamilton-Gray,
OL,7,Fcabinet member for highways and
OL,8,Ftransport at the council, said the
OL,9,Ftrial was about identifying major gaps
OL,10,Fin the local transport links and
OL,11,Faddressing them.
